ely after either a peak or a collapse. Use a pre-agreed review window, compare multiple observations and preserve the creative differences that might explain the change. If a follow-up deliberately tests the same mechanism, define what would count as useful replication beyond matching the largest view count. Audience understanding, qualified responses and production repeatability may be more informative. The aim is not to dismiss real deterioration; it is to stop a dramatic starting point from deciding the story before the evidence arrives."}]]]}],false,false,"$L19","$undefined",false,"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}],"$L1e"]}]
